From 8eb87e1268aa537fed7f7e5f404686b1ea67a249 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhangxinyu <zhengzhongqing@contributor>


Date: Fri, 17 Mar 2023 16:19:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] USERSTORY backport Transform in-list to subquery

Solution:
---------

Backport feature that transform in list to in subquery if list size lager than threshold.

backport from and commit information:

<internal-url-removed>
<internal-url-removed>
<internal-url-removed>
<internal-url-removed>
