<internal-url-removed>
<internal-url-removed>

Limitations:
1. Only support SELECT/INSERT SELECT/REPLACE SELECT.
2. Only support In predicate, and can use index.
3. Only support regular query and prepared stmt.

If anything wrong when doing transform, it will rollback to traditional
execute plan. No error or warning will reported. For prepared stmt,
it will prepare again without transform.

Introduce a new variable:
rds_in_predicate_conversion_threshold
  Default value: 0.
  Description: The minimum number of scalar elements in the value list
               of IN predicate that triggers its conversion to IN
               subquery. Set to 0 to disable the conversion.

Pass Asan and valgrind memory test.
