+Warnings:
+Note	1003	/* select#1 */ select `test`.`t1`.`a` AS `a`,`test`.`t1`.`b` AS `b` from `test`.`t1` where (`test`.`t1`.`a` = 1)
+# IN-subquery with VALUES structure(s) : UNION with VALUES on the first place
+select * from t1
+where a in (select 1 union select 2);
